    "snake": "#74 corpus snake tasks all use a 6x6 board (37 objects) with snake length 2 (bfs) and 1-2 spawn apples (bfs easy 26 expansions, medium 98). With any spawn apple bfs exhausted the 128-expansion ceiling on 16/16 pilot seeds, so both strata use the empty 6x6 corpus board without respawn; the structural axis is snake length 2 -> 3.",
